<instruction name="VSQRTSH">
 <copyright>Copyright (C) Intel Corporation. All Rights Reserved.</copyright>
 <shortdesc>Compute Square Root of Scalar FP16 Value</shortdesc>
 <longdesc><para unique="1046133">
   <string>This instruction performs a scalar FP16 square-root computation on the source operand and stores the FP16 result in the destination operand. Bits 127:16 of the destination operand are copied from the corresponding bits of the first source operand. Bits MAXVL-1:128 of the destination operand are zeroed. The low FP16 element of the desti&#173;nation is updated according to the writemask.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
 <subsection title="Intel C/C++ Compiler Intrinsic Equivalent">
  <para unique="1046145">
   <string>VSQRTSH __m128h _mm_mask_sqrt_round_sh (__m128h src, __mmask8 k, __m128h a, __m128h b, const int rounding);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046146">
   <string>VSQRTSH __m128h _mm_maskz_sqrt_round_sh (__mmask8 k, __m128h a, __m128h b, const int rounding);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046147">
   <string>VSQRTSH __m128h _mm_sqrt_round_sh (__m128h a, __m128h b, const int rounding);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046148">
   <string>VSQRTSH __m128h _mm_mask_sqrt_sh (__m128h src, __mmask8 k, __m128h a, __m128h b);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046149">
   <string>VSQRTSH __m128h _mm_maskz_sqrt_sh (__mmask8 k, __m128h a, __m128h b);</string></para>
  <para unique="1046150">
   <string>VSQRTSH __m128h _mm_sqrt_sh (__m128h a, __m128h b);</string></para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="SIMD Floating-Point Exceptions">
  <para unique="1046152">
   <string>Invalid, Precision, Denormal</string></para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Other Exceptions">
  <para unique="1046157" format="xIndent1">
   <string>EVEX-encoded instructions, see </string><link linkend="63155: 06_Table: Table 2-47. Type E3 Class Exception Conditions"><string>Table&#160;2&#8209;49, &#8220;Type E3 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</string></link></para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
